@startuml
title Inventory State Machine

[*] --> InitialState : /start

state InitialState <<choice>>
InitialState --> AddGoods : [Add new goods]
InitialState --> UpdatePrice : [Update existing item price]
InitialState --> RemoveGoods : [Remove goods]
InitialState --> ExpireNotification : [Check for expired goods]

state AddGoods
AddGoods : entry / start adding goods
AddGoods : do / add new goods to inventory
AddGoods : exit / goods added

state UpdatePrice
UpdatePrice : entry / start updating price
UpdatePrice : do / update existing item price
UpdatePrice : exit / price updated

state RemoveGoods
RemoveGoods : entry / start removing goods
RemoveGoods : do / remove goods from inventory
RemoveGoods : exit / goods removed

state ExpireNotification
ExpireNotification : entry / check for expired goods
ExpireNotification : do / notify user about removal of expired goods
ExpireNotification : exit / notification sent

state "Place Order" as PlaceOrder
PlaceOrder : entry / start placing order
PlaceOrder : do / place an order with supplier
PlaceOrder : exit / order placed

state InvoiceGeneration
InvoiceGeneration : entry / generate invoice
InvoiceGeneration : do / generate invoice for the order
InvoiceGeneration : exit / invoice generated

state SearchItems
SearchItems : entry / search items in inventory
SearchItems : do / select items for purchase
SearchItems : exit / items selected

state CalculateDiscountTax
CalculateDiscountTax : entry / calculate discount and tax
CalculateDiscountTax : do / apply discount and tax based on selected items
CalculateDiscountTax : exit / discount and tax applied

state ReceiptGeneration
ReceiptGeneration : entry / generate receipt
ReceiptGeneration : do / generate receipt for the purchase
ReceiptGeneration : exit / receipt generated

state ReplaceOrCancel
ReplaceOrCancel : entry / replace or cancel receipt
ReplaceOrCancel : do / replace item or cancel receipt during billing process
ReplaceOrCancel : exit / action completed

state SummaryReport
SummaryReport : entry / view transaction summary report
SummaryReport : do / generate and display transaction summary report
SummaryReport : exit / report generated

InitialState --> AddGoods
InitialState --> UpdatePrice
InitialState --> RemoveGoods
InitialState --> ExpireNotification
InitialState --> PlaceOrder
InitialState --> SearchItems
InitialState --> CalculateDiscountTax
InitialState --> ReceiptGeneration
InitialState --> ReplaceOrCancel
InitialState --> SummaryReport

PlaceOrder --> InvoiceGeneration
SearchItems --> CalculateDiscountTax
CalculateDiscountTax --> ReceiptGeneration
ReceiptGeneration --> ReplaceOrCancel
ReplaceOrCancel --> [*]
SummaryReport --> [*]

@enduml
